        "Description": "Your mission is to eliminate two targets, influencer &amp; home designer Leopoldo Olmeda, and local celebrity Helen West.\r\rHelen is the sibling of the elusive Thomas West, which after having seen her sick work, is interested in using her for an assassination against yet unknown targets.\r\rBoth Leopoldo and West hold intel regarding Thomas, so please stash them away where they will not be seen, and inform our agents on the other of the park bridge of their location to extract the needed information.",
